# Mock Exam Rule

When the user requests a simulated mock exam or full test:
1. Follow the runbook in `skills/mock-exam/SKILL.md`.
2. Assemble a balanced exam paper covering 100% of the syllabus from `Knowledge_Ledger/knowledge_ledger.json`.
3. If no past exams exist, synthesize authentic problems from in-slide exercises and learning objectives.
4. Proctor the exam in timed blocks or generate a full markdown exam paper.
5. Grade point-by-point against official professorial criteria and locked terms.
6. Generate a Diagnostic Post-Mortem Report and update the review urgency queue in the ledger.
